{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"luxun-e-o006b","title":"淳于式表陆议枉取民人","accounts":[{"id":"luxun-e-o006b-account","label":"《陆逊传第十三》正文","text":"淳于式表陆议枉取民人","evidence":["luxun-e-o006b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"luxun-p0007","role":"上表","evidence":["luxun-e-o006b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"陆议平东三郡后","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["luxun-e-o006b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"luxun-e-o006b-q","source_order":[58,24,"O006b"],"order":10295}],"persons":[{"id":"luxun-p0007","name":"淳于式","evidence":["luxun-q-o006"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"luxun-m-o006-luxun-p0007","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["luxun-q-o006"]},{"id":"luxun-m-o007-luxun-p0007","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["luxun-q-o007"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"luxun-e-o006b-q","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-e59284437c835a7d6d5a","layer":"original","quote":"会稽太守淳于式表逊枉取民人，愁扰所在。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":23,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":45,"end":64},{"id":"luxun-q-o006","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-e59284437c835a7d6d5a","layer":"original","quote":"遂部伍东三郡〖5〗：强者为兵，羸者补户〖6〗，得精卒数万人。宿恶荡除，所过肃清，还屯芜湖。会稽太守淳于式表逊枉取民人，愁扰所在。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":23,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":64},{"id":"luxun-q-o007","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-351551bbb867748a1854","layer":"original","quote":"逊后诣都，言次〖7〗，称式佳吏。权曰：“式白君，而君荐之，何也？”逊对曰：“式意欲养民，是以白逊。若逊复毁式以乱圣听，不可长也！”权曰：“此诚长者之事〖8〗。顾人不能为耳〖9〗。”","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":24,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":90}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
